-- =====================================================================
-- Equity Trading App : sample TRADE data (1148 rows, 86 customers)
-- Run AFTER 03_insert_customer_data.sql (customers are looked up by customer_code,
-- so it works whatever customer_id values the sequence assigned).
--
-- Rules the data follows:
--   * Trading days 2026-07-01 .. 2026-10-02, weekdays only, 02-Oct (Gandhi Jayanti) excluded;
--     trade_time is IST, within market hours 09:15-15:30.
--   * Only KYC-VERIFIED customers trade; INACTIVE accounts have no trades; SUSPENDED and
--     CLOSED accounts stop trading part-way, and CLOSED accounts sell all holdings first.
--   * CNC (delivery) sells never exceed the quantity bought; MIS (intraday) positions are
--     bought and squared off the same day.
--   * Settlement is T+1; trades settled by 2026-10-04 are SETTLED, the rest EXECUTED.
--     A few buys are CANCELLED / FAILED (no settlement, no charges, no holding).
--   * Some orders are filled in two trades (same order_id).
--   * brokerage = min(20, 0.03% of value); taxes = STT + exchange charges + stamp duty
--     + SEBI fee + 18% GST.
--   * Prices are an illustrative random walk, not real market prices.
-- Re-runnable: existing trade_ref_no values are skipped.
-- =====================================================================

